---
import DashboardLayout from '../../layouts/DashboardLayout.astro';
---

<DashboardLayout title="Analitik Pembelajaran">
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto w-full flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-0">

    <style>
      #analytics-tabs .an-tab-btn.is-active {
        border-color: var(--color-ink, #0c0a09);
        color: var(--color-ink, #0c0a09);
        font-weight: 600;
      }
    </style>

    <div class="mb-6 shrink-0 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink tracking-tight mb-2">Analitik Pembelajaran</h1>
        <p class="text-body text-[16px] text-muted">Analitik tingkat kesulitan siswa &amp; efektivitas rekomendasi AI dari pola interaksi dengan AI Buddy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <select id="filter-project" class="bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline-strong rounded-[8px] px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-ink focus:outline-none min-w-[170px] cursor-pointer">
          <option value="all">Semua Project</option>
        </select>
        <button id="btn-refresh" class="bg-ink text-white rounded-[8px] px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-semibold hover:opacity-90 transition"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate mr-1"></i> Muat</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="analytics-empty" class="hidden text-center py-16 text-muted">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie text-4xl mb-3 opacity-40"></i>
      <p>Belum ada data interaksi untuk dianalisis.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
      <!-- Section 1: histogram distribusi tingkat kesulitan -->
      <section class="bg-surface-card border border-hairline rounded-[16px] p-5 md:p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-[16px] font-bold text-ink mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high text-primary mr-1.5"></i> Distribusi Tingkat Kesulitan Siswa</h2>
        <p class="text-[12px] text-muted mb-4">Berapa banyak sesi yang Lancar vs mulai/sedang kesulitan.</p>
        <div id="difficulty-chart"></div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: tab menu analitik lanjutan -->
      <section class="bg-surface-card border border-hairline rounded-[16px] p-5 md:p-6 shadow-sm mb-8">
        <!-- Mobile: dropdown pilih menu -->
        <select id="analytics-tab-select" class="sm:hidden w-full bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline-strong rounded-[8px] px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-ink focus:outline-none cursor-pointer mb-5">
          <option value="an-pane-confusing">Topik Membingungkan</option>
          <option value="an-pane-efficiency">Efisiensi Jawaban</option>
          <option value="an-pane-topics">Topik Sering Ditanya</option>
          <option value="an-pane-eval">Evaluasi Model</option>
        </select>
        <!-- Desktop: tab bar (flex-wrap, tanpa scrollbar) -->
        <div id="analytics-tabs" class="hidden sm:flex flex-wrap gap-1 border-b border-hairline mb-5">
          <button type="button" class="an-tab-btn is-active whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-3 -mb-px border-b-2 border-transparent text-[14px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors" data-target="an-pane-confusing"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation text-[#bfa059] mr-1.5"></i> Topik Membingungkan</button>
          <button type="button" class="an-tab-btn whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-3 -mb-px border-b-2 border-transparent text-[14px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors" data-target="an-pane-efficiency"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-[#6f8f6a] mr-1.5"></i> Efisiensi Jawaban</button>
          <button type="button" class="an-tab-btn whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-3 -mb-px border-b-2 border-transparent text-[14px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors" data-target="an-pane-topics"><i class="fa-solid fa-fire text-[#c08472] mr-1.5"></i> Topik Sering Ditanya</button>
          <button type="button" class="an-tab-btn whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-3 -mb-px border-b-2 border-transparent text-[14px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors" data-target="an-pane-eval"><i class="fa-solid fa-flask text-[#8f82a6] mr-1.5"></i> Evaluasi Model</button>
        </div>

        <div id="an-pane-confusing" class="an-pane">
          <p class="text-[12px] text-muted mb-4">Topik yang paling sering muncul saat siswa kesulitan.</p>
          <div id="confusing-chart"></div>
        </div>

        <div id="an-pane-efficiency" class="an-pane hidden">
          <p class="text-[12px] text-muted mb-4">Berapa persen dijawab Sistem/Cache vs AI (menghemat kuota AI).</p>
          <div id="efficiency-chart"></div>
        </div>

        <div id="an-pane-topics" class="an-pane hidden">
          <p class="text-[12px] text-muted mb-4">Kebutuhan bantuan siswa secara umum.</p>
          <div id="topics-chart"></div>
        </div>

        <div id="an-pane-eval" class="an-pane hidden">
          <p class="text-[12px] text-muted mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Langkah: <b>(1)</b> Unduh dataset prediksi. <b>(2)</b> Isi kolom <code>actual</code> dengan label asli hasil anotasi
            (<code>lancar</code> / <code>mulai_bingung</code> / <code>kesulitan</code>). <b>(3)</b> Unggah lagi untuk menghitung
            akurasi, precision, recall, F1, &amp; confusion matrix.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <button id="btn-export-eval" class="bg-ink text-white rounded-[8px] px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold hover:opacity-90"><i class="fa-solid fa-download mr-1"></i> Unduh Dataset Prediksi (CSV)</button>
            <label class="bg-violet-600 text-white rounded-[8px] px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold hover:opacity-90 cursor-pointer">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-upload mr-1"></i> Unggah CSV Berlabel &amp; Hitung
              <input type="file" id="file-eval" accept=".csv" class="hidden">
            </label>
            <span id="eval-status" class="text-[12px] text-muted"></span>
          </div>
          <div id="eval-results"></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

  </div>
  <script src="../../scripts/pages/analytics.page.js"></script>
</DashboardLayout>
